===Etymology===
{{dercat|ang|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*skrīþan}}.

{{rel-top|Cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|osx|skrīthan}}, {{cog|dum|schriden}} ({{cog|nl|schrijden}}), {{cog|goh|skrītan}} ({{cog|de|schreiten}}), {{cog|non|skríða}} ({{cog|sv|skrida}}). The Indo-European root also gave Latin {{m|la|crīsō|crīsāre}} and Middle Irish {{m|mga|crith}} (Breton {{m|br|skrija||tremble with fear}}). {{rel-bottom}}

